* Mutant of the reference: 50 kohm resistors in series with both input gates add thermal noise.
.subckt fd_opamp vss ibias vdd vcm vinp vinn voutp voutn
* bias: 10 uA reference into an NMOS diode
XB0 ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=12.8 nf=4
XTAIL tail ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=76.8 nf=24
XT2 t2 ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=8 w=72 nf=18
* stage 1 (vinp -> o1n inverting)
XM1 o1n gp tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=2 w=16 nf=4
XM2 o1p gn tail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=2 w=16 nf=4
XM3 o1n c1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=2 w=144 nf=36
XM4 o1p c1 vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=2 w=144 nf=36
R1A o1n c1 1meg
R1B o1p c1 1meg
* stage 2 (o1n -> dB non-inverting, o1p -> dA non-inverting)
XA2 dA o1n t2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=8 nf=2
XB2 dB o1p t2 vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=8 nf=2
XL2A dA ce vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=4 nf=1
XL2B dB ce vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=4 nf=1
* stage 3: LVT PMOS common source, fixed 150 uA NMOS sink
XM5 voutp dB vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=30 nf=8
XM6 voutn dA vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=30 nf=8
XS5 voutp ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=192 nf=60
XS6 voutn ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=2 w=192 nf=60
* nested Miller compensation (per half circuit), both capacitors with series resistors
RM1P voutp m1p 1.5k
CM1P m1p o1n 4p
RM2P voutp m2p 6k
CM2P m2p dB 1.2p
RM1N voutn m1n 1.5k
CM1N m1n o1p 4p
RM2N voutn m2n 6k
CM2N m2n dA 1.2p
* CMFB: resistive output-CM sense; error pair; sense-side PMOS diode ce
RS1 voutp cms 2meg
RS2 voutn cms 2meg
CS1 voutp cms 100f
CS2 voutn cms 100f
XE0 te ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=8 w=72 nf=18
XE1 ea vcm te vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=32 nf=8
XE2 ce cms te vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=32 nf=8
XE3 ea ea vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=4 nf=1
XE4 ce ce vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8_lvt l=1 w=4 nf=1
* series gate resistors
RGP vinp gp 50k
RGN vinn gn 50k
.ends fd_opamp
